  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You channel the water through your body, making your movements swift and fluid.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, your <strong>Defense</strong> increases by <strong>+1</strong>, and your <strong>Stride</strong> speed increases by <strong>+5</strong>.</p><p>Once per turn, if a melee attack misses you, you may immediately force the attacker to make an <strong>Reflex</strong> check or fall prone, as you strike them with an opportunistic blast of water.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the bonus to <strong>Defense</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p>You may also increase the bonus to your <strong>Stride </strong>speed by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 extra successes.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.iBpYxfJclFMz5zCP]{Water Attunement}</p>",
